---
source: crates/jsonschema-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stdout)"
---
Bundle a JSON Schema into a Compound Schema Document

Usage: jsonschema-cli bundle [OPTIONS] <SCHEMA>

Arguments:
  <SCHEMA>  Path to the root JSON Schema file to bundle

Options:
      --resource <RESOURCES>       Register an external schema resource: URI=FILE (may be repeated)
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>            Write bundled output to FILE instead of stdout
      --connect-timeout <SECONDS>  Timeout for establishing connections (in seconds)
      --timeout <SECONDS>          Total timeout for HTTP requests (in seconds)
  -k, --insecure                   Skip TLS certificate verification (dangerous!)
      --cacert <FILE>              Path to a custom CA certificate file (PEM format)
      --offline                    Refuse to fetch references outside --resource
  -h, --help                       Print help
